@startuml setup_state
!theme cyborg
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName SansSerif
skinparam backgroundColor #0b1018
skinparam defaultFontColor #e6edf7
skinparam ArrowColor #a9b8ca
title L2_COMMUNICATION setup workflow
hide empty description
state "Read stored network" as Boot
state "Scan networks" as Scan
state "Portal selection" as Portal
state "Join selected network" as Join
state "Persist accepted network" as Save
state "Close setup resources" as Close
state "Station connected" as Connected
state "Report failure" as Failure
[*] --> Boot
Boot --> Join : usable record
Boot --> Scan : no usable record
Scan --> Portal : completed list; open setup services
Portal --> Join : typed Connect request
Portal --> Scan : typed Rescan request
Portal --> Close : Cancel or inactivity
Join --> Save : selected network has address [portal]
Join --> Connected : selected network has address [boot/recovery]
Join --> Failure : failed
Scan --> Failure : failed
Save --> Close : result or save warning published
Failure --> Scan : portal join failure / refresh
Failure --> Close : cannot continue setup
Close --> Connected : station retained
Close --> [*] : no station / offline
Connected --> Join : Idle link-loss recovery
Connected --> Scan : manual setup request in Idle
Connected --> [*] : return to CONTROL
note bottom
 CONTROL owns mode admission and listening priority.
 COMMUNICATION safely cancels setup before releasing the network lease.
 Retry counts, deadlines and result display belong to detailed design.
end note
@enduml
